\* All TLC check configs for AntflyTransactionSession.tla, one section per check.
\* Sections are verbatim TLC config syntax; the build extracts them
\* (scripts/tla-cfg.sh). Section names match the make-target check ids.

==== positive
\* TLC config for AntflyTransactionSession.tla

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyRollbackExposeDiscarded = FALSE
    BuggyRecoveryWrongDecision = FALSE
    BuggyCleanupUnresolved = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    NoVisibleUncommittedWrites
    CommitRequiresAllPrepared
    CommitPublishesStagedWrites
    AbortPreservesVisibility
    SavepointWithinStage
    RollbackDiscardedNotVisible
    IntentCountWithinStagedWrites
    IdentityRowsMatchVisibleDocs
    ParticipantRecoveryDoesNotPublishAbortedData
    CleanupRequiresAllResolved
    IdleHasNoDanglingIntents
    Safety

==== BadCleanup
\* Expected-failure config for AntflyTransactionSession.tla.
\* Enables a mutant where finalized transaction metadata is cleaned before all
\* participants are resolved.
\* Pinned to the specific semantic invariant this mutant must violate.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyRollbackExposeDiscarded = FALSE
    BuggyRecoveryWrongDecision = FALSE
    BuggyCleanupUnresolved = TRUE

INVARIANTS
    CleanupRequiresAllResolved

==== BadRecoveryDecision
\* Expected-failure config for AntflyTransactionSession.tla.
\* Enables a mutant where recovery publishes aborted intent data as if it were
\* committed.
\* Pinned to the specific semantic invariant this mutant must violate.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyRollbackExposeDiscarded = FALSE
    BuggyRecoveryWrongDecision = TRUE
    BuggyCleanupUnresolved = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    ParticipantRecoveryDoesNotPublishAbortedData

==== BadRollback
\* Expected-failure config for AntflyTransactionSession.tla.
\* Enables a mutant where rollback-to-savepoint exposes discarded staged data.
\* Pinned to the specific semantic invariant this mutant must violate.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyRollbackExposeDiscarded = TRUE
    BuggyRecoveryWrongDecision = FALSE
    BuggyCleanupUnresolved = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    RollbackDiscardedNotVisible
